{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07285","headline":"和袁郎中破贼後军行过剡中山水谨上太尉 · 刘长卿","name":"和袁郎中破贼後军行过剡中山水谨上太尉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"剡路除荆棘，王师罢鼓鼙。\n农归沧海畔，围解赤城西。\n赦罪春阳发，收兵太白低。\n远峰来马首，横笛入猨啼。\n兰渚催新幄，桃源识故蹊。\n已闻开阁待，谁许卧东溪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07285.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07285","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}